{"data":[{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":25,"impression_count":1743,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"},{"author_id":"2257326878","created_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109871060703490112"],"id":"2109871060703490112","in_reply_to_user_id":"1526603809635856384","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":168,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Amit4Films Also be wary of the massive crowd surges post Shashthi,that might compel you to remain queued for hours in a single pandal.Try getting the most famous ones checked before if you can.Sreebhumi, Santosh Mitra Square,Ekdalia Evergreen,Tridhara,Mudiali,Bagbazar,etc.All the best :)","url":"https://x.com/ayash_jaihind/status/2109871060703490112"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109527758665854976","3_2109527771450134528"]},"author_id":"2084548793731895296","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:13:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109527792610374058"],"id":"2109527792610374058","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":3793,"like_count":110,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"Visited the 23 Palli Durga Temple in Harish Mukherjee Road, Kolkata. This beautiful temple where I go every year on the day of Mahalaya is directly opposite to Shant